{"title":"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\">Problem 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For all non-zero numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/e/42e702421a19b66bd199f2d7417790223192e51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 1/y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/5/a6510526f20fa703654c0775023652df229540ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(x-\\frac{1}{x}\\right)\\left(y+\\frac{1}{y}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"150\" height=\"45\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/a/e3a1e32cdb62097857ddeb4aeebc0886ab1743dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }2x^2\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }2y^2\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }x^2+y^2\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }x^2-y^2\\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }y^2-x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"531\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using substitution, we can substitute y into the equation in the first parentheses. \nTherefore, we'll get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/e/f1edb160fe876c934f42669cd4e6f20ab3f0eb36.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left(x-\\frac{1}{\\frac{1}{y}}\\right)\\left(y+\\frac{1}{y}\\right)\\]\" width=\"143\" height=\"53\" />\n</p><p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/1/ab12eccdbf3d17532be916c1f2ef833c83f7ec3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{1}{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"50\" height=\"42\" />, we can also see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/8/4f8c901e38ed39929dda3b04c71e94d3ca028df8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\frac{1}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"37\" />. Using substitution again, we can substitute x into the second equation getting\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/d/fcdfcbf7e311050f8da32449b234f7ca1f355042.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left(x-\\frac{1}{\\frac{1}{y}}\\right)\\left(y+\\frac{1}{\\frac{1}{x}}\\right)\\]\" width=\"144\" height=\"53\" />\n</p><p>Simplifying, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/8/b581566d5492efdefec5416c07d835cc27fbc53f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-y)(y+x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"111\" height=\"18\" />. Multiplying, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/7/7d726fa5b5d0f9333bee2252b3b1a656aced2ec9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)   }x^2-y^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"104\" height=\"31\" />\n</p><p>~awin\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME\" title=\"1978 AHSME\">1978 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1978 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1978\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=